  "prefLabel": "Puc 2602.07 Demand response programs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2602.07 “Demand response programs” means mechanisms to reduce the demand from electricity customers in response to supply conditions, peak demand, or market prices.\n\nSource. #9352, INTERIM, eff 1-1-09; ss by #9615, eff 12-12-09",
